#. module: insurance_management_account_accountant
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:insurance_management_account_accountant.field_insurance_policy__accrual_method
msgid ""
"How the premium is spread as an expense over the policy months. Taken from "
"the settings when the policy is created."
msgstr ""
"Cómo se reparte el premio como gasto en los meses de la póliza. Se toma de "
"los ajustes al crear la póliza."

